{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "fleet-api-08-trip-costs",
		"name": "08. Trip Costs",
		"description": "Trip cost management with structured cost IDs.\n\n## Cost Structure\nAll costs require:\n- `cost_id`: Unique identifier (e.g., TC-001-002)\n- `cost_label`: Display label (e.g., Diesel)\n- `group_id`: Group identifier (e.g., TC-G-001)\n\n## Cost Groups\n\n**TC-G-001 - Fuel & Energy:**\n- TC-001-001 (Petrol), TC-001-002 (Diesel), TC-001-003 (CNG/LPG), TC-001-004 (EV Charging)\n- Extra fields: fuel_quantity, fuel_rate, km_per_liter\n\n**TC-G-002 - Toll & Parking:**\n- TC-002-001 (Toll), TC-002-002 (Parking), TC-002-003 (Entry Charges)\n\n**TC-G-003 - Loading & Unloading:**\n- TC-003-001 (Loading), TC-003-002 (Unloading), TC-003-003 (Crane/Forklift), TC-003-004 (Labor)\n\n**TC-G-004 - Driver Expenses:**\n- TC-004-001 (Allowance), TC-004-002 (Food), TC-004-003 (Accommodation)\n\n**TC-G-005 - Permits & Compliance:**\n- TC-005-001 (State Permit), TC-005-002 (National Permit), TC-005-003 (Special Permit), TC-005-004 (Chalan/Fine)\n\n**TC-G-006 - Miscellaneous:**\n- TC-006-001 (Police), TC-006-002 (RTO), TC-006-003 (Weighbridge), TC-006-004 (Commission), TC-006-005 (Other)\n- TC-006-005 requires: custom_cost_label\n\n## Permissions\n- Add/Edit: All roles\n- Delete: Owner, GM, Manager only",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{"key": "base_url", "value": "https://indusjs-fleet-docker-960880113496.asia-south2.run.app/api/v2", "type": "string"},
		{"key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string"},
		{"key": "trip_id", "value": "1", "type": "string"},
		{"key": "vehicle_id", "value": "1", "type": "string"},
		{"key": "cost_id", "value": "1", "type": "string"}
	],
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [{"key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string"}]
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Get Trip Cost Types",
			"request": {
				"method": "GET",
				"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
